amily and learns about the task before him, Touko struggles to keep her place on the truck. But even if she succeeds, an unexpected obstacle may cut her journey short.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dDxtWczmpYVK7LNenNxhdZflchg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dDxtWczmpYVK7LNenNxhdZflchg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4161118","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Touko and her companions flee the wreckage of their trucks, Koushi digs through the archive for forgotten tomes. What he discovers casts his mission in a new light.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A9boGYOdPrX539X58AwBw99PX3A.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A9boGYOdPrX539X58AwBw99PX3A.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4161119","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The survivors of the dragon attack receive unexpected aid from Akira, a lady fire hunter with an unconventional hound. Later, they come upon an abandoned child...with ties to the group that wants them dead.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rpEWjeeffZOYdtDpLd6Rn4eJsbs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rpEWjeeffZOYdtDpLd6Rn4eJsbs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"4161120","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Their long journey over, Touko's party rests with Shouzou's family in the capital. Koushi enters the forest with the aid of the enigmatic fire hunter Roroku.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dkDeu3NVGJfiJ3GO1Dif7XZC2jA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dkDeu3NVGJfiJ3GO1Dif7XZC2jA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"4161121","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Touko loses her way while running from the city watch and receives unexpected help from Kira. Meanwhile, Koushi approaches Yuoshichi and Roroku with a daring plan.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pgnMlxeLNApGg7wkKsRfrNbtUQq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pgnMlxeLNApGg7wkKsRfrNbtUQq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"4161122","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Touko and Kouji follow a treefolk child into a forbidden area of the capital, where they make a startling discovery. But the spies of the gods are hot on their heels.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-03-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y21R6YFxqVfb1lOJGuMHju09mCF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y21R6YFxqVfb1lOJGuMHju09mCF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"4161123","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"War looms over the capital, and Koushi's work with for Yuoshichi Okibi is coming to a head. On the eve of their new weapon's final test, two unexpected visitors complicate the situation. Who can Koushi trust, and what does he truly want to accomplish?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-03-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2AHRdhdje9hZcVL7YxiUTphOHTL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2AHRdhdje9hZcVL7YxiUTphOHTL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"4161124","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hinako's illness worsens, provoking a crisis at the Okibi mansion. Meanwhile, Touko joins Akira to confront the gods. New forces and unguessed truths emerge as Flickering Flame draws ever closer.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-03-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2jBtyNAEzhmjxEMyhzwh2DK5Hc8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2jBtyNAEzhmjxEMyhzwh2DK5Hc8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156688/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"5071527","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fiends flood into the factory district ahead of the spider invasion. Despite Akira urging her to run, Touko stands her ground and joins the fight. But what toll will a real battle take on her? And can anyone stem the tide now?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/91ZxK54yFyVFG3lIO3SwfsVxGKz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/91ZxK54yFyVFG3lIO3SwfsVxGKz.jp